Third-party components

This product invokes the following AWS services at runtime (not bundled):
- Amazon Web Services SDK for Python (boto3, botocore) — Apache License 2.0,
  available via the AWS Lambda runtime; no source bundled in this repository.

This product's documentation references third-party FinOps tooling for
context only; no source from those tools is bundled:
- Apptio Cloudability — proprietary, Apptio Inc.
- AWS Compute Optimizer, AWS Cost Optimization Hub, AWS Cost Explorer,
  AWS Budgets, AWS Cost Anomaly Detection — proprietary, Amazon Web
  Services, Inc.

Diagrams in /diagrams/ are generated using the diagrams Python library
(https://diagrams.mingrammer.com/) — MIT License — and rendered with
Graphviz — Common Public License 1.0. Neither library is bundled; both
are dependencies declared in /diagrams/requirements.txt.
